trait-luam-chrome-intolerance-name = Chrome Intolerance
trait-luam-chrome-intolerance-desc = Your body and mind reject cyberware. Your humanity is always 0 and neural chips do not raise it: any implant risks cyberpsychosis.
trait-luam-chrome-loyalty-name = Chrome Loyalty
trait-luam-chrome-loyalty-desc = You get along with cyberware easily. Your humanity is raised by 2.
trait-luam-plasteel-mantis-blades-name = Plasteel Mantis Blades
trait-luam-plasteel-mantis-blades-desc = You start the shift with a plasteel mantis blade in each arm. Costs 0.5 humanity per arm.
trait-luam-thermal-eye-modules-name = Thermal Eye Modules
trait-luam-thermal-eye-modules-desc = A thermal eye implant stolen from the TSF and sold on the black market. Grants thermal vision. Costs 1 humanity.
